    },
    {
      "text": "The non-molestation order can be made without notice to Ryan Hale due to the history of strangulation and threats to kill, allowing him to respond at a return hearing.",
      "cites": [
        52,
        53
      ],
      "section": "Advice given"
    },
    {
      "text": "Breaching a non-molestation order is a criminal offence, and Leanne should call the police immediately if Ryan Hale breaks it.",
      "cites": [
        55
      ],
      "section": "Advice given"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ryan Hale has parental responsibility for Mia as he is listed on the birth certificate.",
