  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott bruised her arm during the fall but did not go to hospital.",
    "cites": [18],
    "section": "Needs and daily living"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott cooks occasionally, making soup and sandwiches, and says she is not one for cooking for one.",
