    "section": "Needs and daily living"
  },
  {
    "text": "Karen brings meals to Doreen and she eats what is brought by Karen.",
    "cites": [21],
    "section": "Needs and daily living"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott has her pension and a portion of Ron's council benefits.",
