    "section": "Needs and daily living"
  },
  {
    "text": "Karen manages the bills on the computer.",
    "cites": [23, 24],
    "section": "Needs and daily living"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott said she feels lonely and that days are long and quiet, with no one to talk to.",
    "cites": [28, 29],
    "section": "Needs and daily living"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott said, 'I'd be better off dead, love' when asked about her feelings since Ron's death.",
    "cites": [30],
    "section": "Person's views and wishes"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott said it is just a saying at her age, common among older people, and not a serious statement.",
    "cites": [32],
    "section": "Person's views and wishes"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott said she has been saving 40 tablets since summer, not taking them and keeping them hidden.",
    "cites": [36, 40],
    "section": "Person's views and wishes"
  },
  {
    "text": "Karen Wells found the tablets hidden in Doreen's bedside drawer, in an envelope under hankies, with lots of different tablets.",
    "cites": [42],
    "section": "Risks and safeguarding"
  },
  {
    "text": "Karen Wells took the tablets home with her after finding them.",
    "cites": [44],
    "section": "Risks and safeguarding"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott said she would stop eating if she were put in a home, and that she wants to stay in her current home with Ron's belongings.",
    "cites": [50, 52],
    "section": "Person's views and wishes"
  },
  {
    "text": "The care assessor will refer Doreen for a stairlift assessment and a bath seat.",
