    "section": "Agreed actions"
  },
  {
    "text": "Doreen Abbott said she would be okay with Dr Patel seeing her, as she does not want a fuss.",
    "cites": [54],
    "section": "Agreed actions"
  },
  {
    "text": "The care assessor will inform Dr Patel about what Doreen said during the assessment.",
    "cites": [55],
    "section": "Agreed actions"
  },
  {
    "text": "Karen Wells will take the tablets to the pharmacy today to be disposed of.",
    "cites": [45, 46],
    "section": "Agreed actions"
  },
  {
    "text": "Karen Wells will sort weekly tablet packs with Kestle Pharmacy.",
    "cites": [57, 58],
    "section": "Agreed actions"
  },
  {
    "text": "The care assessor will refer for a stairlift assessment by Friday.",
