    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ryan Hale comes to the flat every weekend since August, typically on Friday or Saturday night, by shouting through the letterbox.",
    "cites": [16],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ryan Hale has not been physically violent towards Leanne Carter since August, except for one incident on the 12th of October.",
    "cites": [20, 22, 24],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "On the 12th of October, Ryan Hale put his hands around Leanne's neck in the hallway while she was opening the door to give Mia's bag.",
    "cites": [20, 22],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne was unable to breathe for a period after the incident.",
    "cites": [20],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Mia was asleep in her room during the incident on the 12th of October.",
    "cites": [24],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne's neighbour called the police after hearing her screaming during the incident on the 12th of October.",
    "cites": [25, 26],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne has a crime reference number for the incident on the 12th of October.",
    "cites": [26],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ryan Hale was arrested by the police on the 12th of October.",
    "cites": [26],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Ryan Hale was released on bail after the arrest, but the bail was later discharged and he is now under investigation with no bail conditions.",
    "cites": [30, 31],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne went to her GP two days after the 12th of October, and the GP recorded marks on her neck.",
    "cites": [34],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "On the 20th of October, Ryan Hale came to the flat and smashed Leanne's phone, which she had to replace at a cost of about two hundred pounds.",
    "cites": [36, 38],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne reported the phone-smashing incident to the officer on the case.",
    "cites": [37],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "On the 3rd of November, Ryan Hale sent a text message to Leanne threatening to kill her.",
    "cites": [40],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne has a screenshot of the threatening text message from the 3rd of November.",
    "cites": [42],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne has additional voice notes from Ryan Hale threatening her, saying 'I'll regret it'.",
    "cites": [42],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne's friend Gemma told her that Ryan Hale keeps a knife in his van for work.",
    "cites": [46],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne has not personally seen the knife in Ryan Hale's van.",
    "cites": [48],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "Leanne wants Ryan Hale to stop coming to the flat and stop messaging her.",
    "cites": [50],
    "section": "Client's account"
  },
  {
    "text": "The solicitor advised that a non-molestation order should be applied for to prevent Ryan Hale from contacting Leanne, using or threatening violence, and coming within a set radius,",
    "cites": [51],
    "section": "Advice given"
  },
  {
    "text": "The non-molestation order could be made without notice to Ryan Hale due to the history of strangulation and threats to kill.",
    "cites": [53],
    "section": "Advice given"
  } ]}

